# CHAPTER 1: The Monolith vs. The Airport City
### *Microservices Architecture, Bounded Contexts & Distributed Resilience*

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    THE MONOLITHIC AIRPORT TERMINAL                          │
