│  │   Payment Vault Svc  │ ◄─ [CIRCUIT] ───► │  Flight Control Svc  │        │
│  │   (Isolated Engine)  │    [BREAKER]      │  (Zero-Downtime Pod) │        │
│  └──────────────────────┘                   └──────────────────────┘        │
│                                                                             │
│  ✔ ISOLATION: Cargo Hub failure never stops Payment Vault.                  │
